WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:06.429
Video 6. Company banavo: naam, varsh, features
ane GST details.

00:00:06.629 --> 00:00:11.068
Pehla, Company Creation: naam, state ane
financial year.

00:00:10.998 --> 00:00:16.742
Pachhi features, F11 thi: bill-wise entry,
stock ane GST.

00:00:16.672 --> 00:00:22.090
Pachhi GST details. Pachhi company tamara
masters maate taiyaar chhe.

00:00:22.391 --> 00:00:28.902
Nava install ma koi company nathi. Alt+F3 thi
Select Company khule chhe.

00:00:28.932 --> 00:00:31.595
Actions ma Create Company taiyaar chhe.

00:00:31.932 --> 00:00:35.756
Enter dabavo. Company Creation screen khule
chhe.

00:00:36.836 --> 00:00:43.199
Company nu naam lakho: Navrang Textiles.
Hisaab ene mailing name ma copy kare chhe.

00:00:43.229 --> 00:00:51.001
Address lakho. Pachhi List of States khule chhe.
"guj" lakho, ane Gujarat select thay chhe.

00:00:51.031 --> 00:01:01.192
State parthi tax nakki thay chhe: Gujarat ma CGST ane SGST,
bija state maate IGST. Pachhi pincode lakho.

00:01:02.272 --> 00:01:04.916
Financial year sudhi Enter dabavo.

00:01:05.036 --> 00:01:14.323
Hisaab aajni taarikh nu financial year suchave chhe: 1 April
2026 thi. Books pan e j divas thi sharu thay chhe.

00:01:14.353 --> 00:01:20.003
Ctrl+A thi company save thay chhe. Pachhi
features jaate khule chhe.

00:01:21.083 --> 00:01:28.449
Bill-wise entry ane inventory pehle thi chaalu chhe.
Hisaab tamara bills ane stock raakhe chhe.

00:01:28.479 --> 00:01:31.580
GST par, Yes maate Y dabavo.

00:01:31.679 --> 00:01:39.880
Ctrl+A. Have Hisaab GST details puchhe chhe. Pachhi
thi F11 thi aa features fari khule chhe.

00:01:40.960 --> 00:01:45.811
State company maathi aave chhe. Registration
type Regular chhe.

00:01:45.841 --> 00:01:48.827
Tamari company no GSTIN lakho.

00:01:49.526 --> 00:01:56.975
Aa GSTIN fakt ek udaharan chhe. Tamaro potano
GSTIN vaapro.

00:01:57.005 --> 00:02:00.669
Ctrl+A thi GST details save thay chhe.

00:02:00.699 --> 00:02:08.910
Gateway par tamari navi company dekhay chhe. Enu
varsh April 2026 thi March 2027 sudhi chhe.

00:02:09.390 --> 00:02:13.404
Darek navi company ma sharuaat thi 28 groups
hoy chhe.

00:02:13.334 --> 00:02:16.784
Ane be ledgers: Cash, ane Profit & Loss A/c.

00:02:16.984 --> 00:02:21.280
Tamari company taiyaar chhe. Have pachhi:
masters.

